id: pm-vcs-erasureprooftransport
title: Carry optional erasure diagnostics across transports
description: "Native-file accountability and tombstone object IDs/payload digests now decide physical-store certificates; fingerprint transport is not required for certification. Preserve optional positive-copy diagnostics across transports with versioned, validated metadata and no erased bytes. Missing diagnostics remain a reported limitation rather than an absence proof."
